<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept - traders.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both of the two Brent cargoes nominated from the paper chains on Monday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>One of the cargoes, loading Dec 24-26, was kept early by the equity holder Murphy. The other was kept by trading house J.Aron, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
